OL,3,GNEWSAMP asks for confirmation asylum
OL,4,Ahotels will go
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP has again written to the Home
OL,7,FOffice querying the continued use of
OL,8,Fhotels in his constituency to house
OL,9,Fasylum seekers.
OL,11,FIn his letter, Stuart Andrew,
OL,12,FConservative MP for Daventry, said his
OL,13,Fmost recent letter on 21 September,
OL,14,F"remains without answer".
OL,16,FThe MP, who has been raising concerns
OL,17,Fwith the department since 2024, added:
OL,18,F"I was assured, as were my
OL,19,Fconstituents, the use of the hotels
OL,20,Fwould be a temporary arrangement. We
OL,21,Fare now approaching the two-year mark."
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,368,360,200,160,0,100
