OL,3,GNEWSAMP asks for confirmation asylum
OL,4,Ahotels will go
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn response, the Home Office said it
OL,7,Fwas "working to fairly house asylum
OL,8,Fseekers across the country, moving
OL,9,Fasylum seekers into alternative
OL,10,Faccommodation and will end the use of
OL,11,Fasylum hotels by the end of this
OL,12,FParliament."
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
